      "text": "Other Information / Disclaimer:"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "During the validity of the certificate, the certified company is obliged to inform the certification body about relevant changes in the management system and its documentation."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "It should be noted that the audit is conducted based on sampling of available information, which may result in nonconformities in addition to those documented during the audit."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The result of the audit does not relieve the audited company of its responsibility for the control of the existing management system and for the maintenance and conformity with the requirements of the"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The certification body or the auditor shall under no circumstances replace the control carried out by the competent national authorities."
    },
    {
